# The build context is the whole repository, because the server is four path
# packages and a route tree. What it does not need is everything that makes
# that repository large: the Flutter apps' build output, the analyzer's cache,
# and the design shots.
#
# Written down because the alternative is a 1 GB context uploaded to the
# daemon on every build, most of it artefacts of the last one.
.git
.dart_tool
**/.dart_tool
build
**/build
apps
packages/bel_design
packages/bel_backoffice
packages/bel_secure_store
packages/bel_client
docs
brand
infra/dev/firebase-data
**/*.iml
.vscode
.claude
